# Copy to .env or set in your Netlify/Render environment.
#
# API base URL used at build time by the frontend (api.ts + CSP injection).
#   - Dev default (unset): http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   - Production, recommended: "/api"  → served by the Netlify proxy
#     (see netlify.toml). The refresh cookie stays same-site, so silent
#     session renewal keeps working.
#   - Alternative: "https://api.your-backend-host.com" (absolute URL —
#     then the backend must send SameSite=None cookies or you lose
#     session persistence across page reloads).
VITE_API_URL=/api
